Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:32:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] feat(trace): report the automatic threshold a trace
 chose (ADR-396)

No visible change on its own. Trace steps can now yield a display-only
report: the filled-outline lane reports the luma the automatic (Otsu)
threshold picked, and whether Line Art's automatic detection added marks
found by local contrast to its 0-128 brightness band. The Trace dialog
needs this so Manual brightness band starts where the automatic threshold
was, and so Line Art can say which route ran.

With Faint lines on, Line Art's colour check does not run, so only an
automatic threshold is reported there.

Nothing reads a report back as an input, so trace output and the options
that key prepared and cached results are unchanged. Runners that do not
show reports treat the yield as one more checkpoint. trace-image.ts gains
one counted line; the builders live in trace-report.ts.

